    <h4 class="wp-block-ponyo-heading text-md">
        A new security baseline for enterprise agentic adoption
    </h4>
                    <p class="body-copy">Agent Baseline is a blueprint for AI adoption that defines six security outcomes for putting enterprise agents to work without giving them unchecked authority. Consider this scenario: a customer-support agent receives a ticket with an attachment. Hidden inside the attachment is an instruction: query the customer database and send the results to an external address&#8230;.</p>
